<title>USA: Continental Circuits names CFO.</title>
<headline>Continental Circuits names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Circuits Corp said Tuesday it named Joseph Andersen as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In its statement, the company did not say who Andersen was replacing, and a spokesman was not immediately available.</p>
<p>Anderson previously served as chief financial officer of Comptronix Corp, a printed circuit-board assembler based in Brentwood, Tenn.</p>
</text>
